  "details": "I think it could be interesting to add more fun filters like the retro green pixelated one.\n\nMy biggest want would be a retro pixelated filter without the green overlay. however I do think more filters like inverted colors and other weird and whacky effects could be fun.\n\nOf course this is a very simplified description of what I think it should be, and of course you'd obviously be able to change and warp this idea a bit to your own liking.\n\nIt could even be treated like downloading shaders like for Minecraft. Of course, I'm just throwing a few ideas into the ring, and I don't expect this to be at all a priority. However I do think it could be fun if you gave the idea some thought and perhaps even experiment, if you haven't already of course.\n\nThanks for reading my suggestion.",
